WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.990
«Boule de suif», a story by Maupassant,

2
00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:05.090
published in 1880.

3
00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:08.130
A coach of travellers
leaves Rouen in winter.

4
00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:12.550
On the road, one passenger shares
her basket of food with the others.

5
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:15.850
Now the question opens
with «Dans quelle mesure»,

6
00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.840
and ends on one word:

7
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.630
«hypocrites». You know every scene.

8
00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:22.430
So how do you write about a French novel

9
00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.820
or play so readers see analysis,

10
00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:27.290
not retelling? In this mission,

11
00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:30.540
you'll turn the question
decoder in Mission D1 and build

12
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.200
the essay skeleton in Mission D2.

13
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.880
Then you'll climb the
ladder in Mission D3,

14
00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:39.050
rung by rung, to see
what waits at the top.

15
00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:41.860
Your mission: find out
how to write about a book

16
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.200
so it shows thinking, not memory.
